cker-option-disabled-text-color\\tvar(--mp-color-text-disabled)\\n--mp-picker-option-check-color\\tvar(--mp-sys-color-content-brand)\\n--mp-picker-option-text-color\\tvar(--mp-color-text-1)\\n--mp-picker-toolbar-padding\\t0 4px\\n--mp-picker-mask-background-image\\tlinear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--mp-picker-background) 90%, transparent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--mp-picker-background) 40%, transparent)), linear-gradient(0deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--mp-picker-background) 90%, transparent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--mp-picker-background) 40%, transparent))\\n\#\\n键盘与减少动效\\n\\n每个可操作列为一个 listbox，可用 Tab 聚焦；方向键上下移动，Home/End 到首尾可用项，跳过禁用项。aria-selected 表达当前滚轮项；selected-values 只表达额外勾选标记，两者职责不同。空列和全禁用列不进入 Tab 顺序。\\n\\n减少动效偏好下，选择立即提交且不等待 transitionend；偏好动态切换时收束待提交滚动，卸载时移除监听。","numericSteps":[],"overflow":[],"previews":["<div class=\\"loca-doc-preview__example\\"><div class=\\"mp-space mp-space--block\\" style=\\"gap: 12px; flex-flow: column; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: stretch; width: 100%;\\"><!----><div class=\\"mp-space__item\\"><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"mp-field-presentation__reference\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-haspopup=\\"dialog\\"><span>✓</span><span aria-hidden=\\"true\\">›</span></button></div><!----><div class=\\"mp-space__item\\"><div class=\\"mp-picker\\" mp-picker-cover=\\"\\"><!--v-if--><div class=\\"mp-picker__columns\\" style=\\"height: 264px;\\"><div class=\\"mp-picker__column\\" role=\\"listbox\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\" aria-label=\\"请选择 1\\" aria-disabled=\\"true\\"><div class=\\"mp-picker__scroller\\" style=\\"transform: translateY(110px); transition-duration: 0ms; transition-property: none;\\"><div id=\\"v-0-0-0\\" role=\\"option\\" aria-selected=\\"true\\" class=\\"mp-picker__option\\" style=\\"height: 44px;\\"><div class=\\"mp-picker__text\\">A</div><!--v-if--></div><div id=\\"v-0-0-1\\" role=\\"option\\" aria-selected=\\"false\\" class=\\"mp-picker__option\\" style=\\"height: 44px;\\"><div class=\\"mp-picker__tex