    # {"failures":[],"diagnostic":{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:49257/mobile.html\#/steps?language=zh-CN","text":"Maple Design Mobile · Cedar’s Mobile Counterpart\\nMaple Design Mobile,Cedar Design Web,Vue 3,TypeScript,移动端组件库,语义 Token,主题定制\\n\\nMaple Design Mobile is a mobile component library built with Vue 3 and TypeScript, maintained by 孟帅 and 吴甲明. It shares semantic tokens and component API conventions with Cedar Design Web and supports on-demand imports, theming and internationalization.\\n\\nSteps\\n中文\\nEnglish\\n基本使用\\nprocess›\\n1\\n步骤1\\n2\\n步骤2\\n3\\n步骤3\\n4\\n步骤4\\n错误状态\\nerror›\\n步骤1\\n步骤2\\n3\\n步骤3\\n可切换\\nprocess›\\n1\\n步骤1\\n这是描述信息\\n2\\n步骤2\\n这是描述信息\\n3\\n步骤3\\n这是描述信息\\n4\\n步骤4\\n这是描述信息\\n垂直模式\\nprocess›\\n1步骤1\\n2步骤2\\n3步骤3\\n4步骤4\\n下一步\\n外观组合\\nstatuswait›\\nsizemd›\\n步骤1\\n2\\n步骤2\\n3\\n步骤3\\nmp-steps · 组合属性›\\n功能调试 / Feature playground\\n重新挂载 / Remount\\n重置 / Reset\\n\\n选择一类功能后调整相关属性。切换功能会清除上一次覆盖，恢复案例原有绑定。 default-* 等初始属性修改后，点击“重新挂载”验证。\\n\\nExplore one feature at a time. Changing the topic removes previous overrides.\\n\\n值与数据 / Value and data›\\n筛选属性 / Filter›\\n值与数据 / Value and data（2）\\n案例插槽 / Fixture slots\\nprocess›\\n1\\n步骤1\\n2\\n步骤2\\n3\\n步骤3\\n4\\n步骤4\\n当前覆盖值 / Active overrides\\n事件 / Events（0）\\n专项 API 定位 / Scenario API index","numericSteps":[],"overflow":[],"previews":["<section data-demo=\\"basic-usage\\"><div class=\\"app-type\\">基本使用</div><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"mp-field-presentation__reference status-switch\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\" aria-haspopup=\\"dialog\\"><span>process</span><span aria-hidden=\\"true\\">›</span></button><div data-v-ce475ba7=\\"\\" role=\\"list\\" class=\\"mp-steps mp-steps-horizontal mp-steps-label-vertical mp-steps-mode-default mp-steps-size-md mp-steps-show-line\\"><div data-v-ce475ba7=\\"\\" role=\\"listitem\\" class=\\"mp-steps-item mp-steps-item-process mp-steps-item-active\\"><div class=\\"mp-steps-item-tail\\"></div><div class=\\"mp-steps-item-node\\"><div class=\\"mp-steps-icon\\">1</div></di